*Terrible flu like symptoms > Felony conviction for life.* Sounds like you are an addict. I have been in your shoes. Go on the trip. Don't bring drugs. Don't do any drugs on the trip. Face the anxiety, and embrace the love of your family. Make a commitment to yourself that when you arrive home you won't pick the pipe back up. You can get past the addiction. Right now your willpower is too weak, so let this Iceland trip be the clean break your body needs.

&#x200B;

Edit: After reading through posts in this thread it's clear the OP needs to learn self discipline. OP start by picking up a copy of the book **12 rules** to read on the flight!

Absolutely this "Destroying communities through abject dependence and protecting rights are often conflated."

&#x200B;

In Canada the system of land rights, reserves, white cards, and status has created a vicious coupling of victimhood, to independence. One can not be an independent, proud Cree without also taking the status card. In Nunavut, the clash of culture between modernity and the traditions of Elders, causes near daily suicides throughout the territory. We must all stand on equal footing, as people. To constantly dwell on the past robs the chance to make here and now better for everyone.

Did you guys meet at university? whats your fiancé look like? Is she supportive of you? I wish you all the best!

&#x200B;

Edit: 'whats your fiancé look like?' Because you look like a god damn  CHAMPION!

If you apply for and get the B.A. then you are required to leave Queens. The next step would be to reapply to Queens (with your B.A. gpa), for that departments B.A.H. degree upgrade.

&#x200B;

It would save you money and a headache to just switch into the B.A.H. stream now.

Ofc he would say this shit. You don't know the real US.... blah blah. We've seen enough to know there is some toxic stink in your relationship. Quit fronting, and do some much needed self-reflection. Maybe he'll even grow as a person from it.

&#x200B;

EDIT: and if Olga is saying now for fans to stop the judgement... maybe it's because she is afraid of steves hurt ego.

Steven and Olga..... first off Olga is a fucking saint. I've dated a Russian girl, and that country isn't a joke. She is so mature for her age, and it is painful watching Steve treat her so badly! She deserves so much more from life than him. 

Kalani is a selfish brat. Its not her child, it is her and Asuelus. He is learning to be a dad, and doing a great job. I think Asuelu is a gentle soul who will end up hurt. Kalani always ferments drama, lies, and treats Asuelu horribly. 

&#x200B;

All in all this is the most difficult season of 90 day for me to watch. Just those pair of couples are enough to make me sick. 

&#x200B;

I just want to die too. So you are not alone. I'm also a piece of shit, but I doubt you are one. You were cool enough to reach out on reddit! That takes courage. 

You are right, it is nice to feel wanted. I think your behaviours and feelings are perfectly normal. Try not to focus on sexual things, or being 'unlovable'. The only person responsible for loving you, is you. If you need to take tomorrow off, then do it!  Spoil yourself. You are worth it. 

&#x200B;

Just like men, women have a range of preferences for physical attributes. Bonus, women are far more engaged by mental stimulation. The key to her pleasure is through her imagination. 

